# External signed walk, cited unchanged (probity-a2a-card-walk 2026-10-15)

**Status:** a citation of a walk record that another project measured, signed under its own key and keeps in its own repository. The bytes stay where the walker put them; this entry fixes, on an anchor neither party owns, which bytes they were, which key signed them, and that the walker agreed to this entry. It is not a record of this project's own measurement, and it does not enter the witness pool, whose intake (POST /witness) takes jidec-path-v1 records.

